                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>What is Traya's biggest advantage?</h3>
                                        <p>Consultation-first + doctor + dietitian + coach team + Ayurvedic + modern medicine combined + subscription-program. Multi-dimensional model advantage.</p>
                                        <h3>Can new hair loss D2C brands compete?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes in specific niching (male vs female hair loss specialty, specific hair loss causes, luxury positioning). Category has room.</p>
                                        <h3>Is consultation-model scalable?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes — Traya proves scalable via technology + coach team + protocols. Requires operational discipline + quality control at scale.</p>
                                        <h3>What is the biggest health D2C lesson?</h3>
                                        <p>Program-based + consultation + expert team + subscription combined create defensible health D2C. Not just product — outcome-based service + product.</p>
